component About {
	<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">About Vesk</h1>
	<p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
		Vesk is a compiler-first reactive UI framework. It compiles .vsk components
		to standard ESM with SSR, hydration, and fine-grained reactivity.
	</p>
	<p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
		Key features include zero-JS pages, islands architecture, AOT event delegation,
		and streaming SSR.
	</p>
}
